graph TB
    subgraph TrainingHub["Training Hub Library"]
        direction TB
        Registry[AlgorithmRegistry<br/>Central dispatch]

        subgraph Algorithms["Algorithms"]
            SFT[SFT Algorithm<br/>Supervised Fine-Tuning]
            OSFT[OSFT Algorithm<br/>Optimized SFT]
            LoRA[LoRA Algorithm<br/>Parameter-Efficient Adaptation]
            GRPO[GRPO Algorithm<br/>RL from Verifiable Rewards]
            GEPA[GEPA Algorithm<br/>Gradient-Free Prompt Optimization]
        end

        subgraph Backends["Backends"]
            ILabBackend[InstructLab Training<br/>torchrun distributed SFT]
            MiniTrainerBackend[Mini-Trainer<br/>OSFT execution]
            UnslothBackend[Unsloth<br/>Memory-efficient LoRA]
            ARTBackend[ART Backend<br/>Co-located vLLM + training]
            VeRLBackend[VeRL Backend<br/>Multi-node distributed GRPO]
            GEPABackend[GEPA Backend<br/>Direct optimization]
            MLflowGEPABackend[MLflow GEPA Backend<br/>MLflow-integrated optimization]
        end

        subgraph Adapters["Callback Adapters"]
            CallbackAbs[TrainingHubCallback<br/>Unified lifecycle hooks]
            UnslothAdapter[Unsloth Adapter]
            ILabAdapter[InstructLab Adapter]
            MiniTrainerAdapter[Mini-Trainer Adapter]
        end

        Registry -->|dispatches| SFT
        Registry -->|dispatches| OSFT
        Registry -->|dispatches| LoRA
        Registry -->|dispatches| GRPO
        Registry -->|dispatches| GEPA

        SFT -->|delegates to| ILabBackend
        OSFT -->|delegates to| MiniTrainerBackend
        LoRA -->|delegates to| UnslothBackend
        GRPO -->|delegates to| ARTBackend
        GRPO -->|delegates to| VeRLBackend
        GEPA -->|delegates to| GEPABackend
        GEPA -->|delegates to| MLflowGEPABackend

        CallbackAbs --- UnslothAdapter
        CallbackAbs --- ILabAdapter
        CallbackAbs --- MiniTrainerAdapter
    end

    Caller[Caller Process<br/>Notebook / Training Job Pod] -->|invokes sft&#40;&#41;, lora_grpo&#40;&#41;, gepa&#40;&#41;| Registry

    GEPABackend -->|HTTP via litellm| LLMEndpoint[OpenAI-compatible<br/>LLM Endpoint]
    MLflowGEPABackend -->|HTTP via mlflow SDK| MLflowServer[MLflow Tracking<br/>Server]
    ARTBackend -->|manages| vLLM[vLLM Inference<br/>Co-located GPU]

